    "title": "Lead Investment Banker at RBL Bank Asia Pacific Associates",
    "description": "Join the RBL Bank Asia Pacific Associates family as a Investment Banker in Indore. We believe in empowering our employees with the tools, training, and environment they need to succeed.\n\nAbout RBL Bank Asia Pacific Associates:\nRBL Bank Asia Pacific Associates is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with external auditors during annual audits\n• Prepare annual reports and investor presentations\n• Maintain general ledger and ensure accurate bookkeeping\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n• Monitor market trends and provide investment recommendations\n• Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable functions\n• Conduct due diligence for mergers, acquisitions, and investments\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Master's degree preferred\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Risk Management\n• Proficiency in Financial Reporting\n• Proficiency in Forecasting\n• Proficiency in SAP FICO\n• Proficiency in VBA\n• Proficiency in Python for Finance\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n• Proficiency in QuickBooks\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with RBL Bank Asia Pacific Associates!",
